<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 49.26 to 6806.54.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.45 to 412.35.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.15.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1319 to 1156.</p>
<p>Volume was 467,564,770 compared with 538,607,960 on Friday.</p>
